#: main.cpp:93
msgid ""
"<h1>Icons</h1>This module allows you to choose the icons for your desktop."
"<p>To choose an icon theme, click on its name and apply your choice by pressing "
"the \"Apply\" button below. If you do not want to apply your choice you can "
"press the \"Reset\" button to discard your changes.</p>"
"<p>By pressing the \"Install New Theme\" button you can install your new icon "
"theme by writing its location in the box or browsing to the location. Press the "
"\"OK\" button to finish the installation.</p>"
"<p>The \"Remove Theme\" button will only be activated if you select a theme "
"that you installed using this module. You are not able to remove globally "
"installed themes here.</p>"
"<p>You can also specify effects that should be applied to the icons.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Tamğalar</h1>Östäldä qullanası tamğalarnı bu modul aşa saylap bula."
"<p>Tamğa köyläneşen saylaw öçen, anıñ adına çirtep, \"Aşırt\" digän töymägä "
"basası. Saylawdan yä ki üzgäreştän baş tartu öçen, \"Awdar\" digän töymäçä "
"çirtäse.</p>"
"<p>Tamğalar öçen yaña köyläneş quyu öçen, \"Yaña Köyläneş Quyu\" digän töymägä "
"çirtep, anıñ urınlaşuın quldan yä ki saylap kertäse. Quyu eşen buldıru öçen "
"\"OK\" töymäsenä basası.</p>"
"<p>Bu modul aşa quyılğan köyläneşlärne genä \"Köyläneşne Beter\" digän töymä "
"aşa beterep bula. Töp köyläneşlärne beterep bulmí.</p>"
"<p>Tamğalarda qullanası tä'sirlärne dä saylap bula.</p>"
